  m_Name: Quest1-Mallow
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  initialDialog:
  - "You\u2019ve got soft steps for someone with business in these woods."
  - "\r(He stifles a cough and chuckles faintly.\r\n"
  - "Don\u2019t suppose you\u2019re selling miracles, are you?"
  - "Magic\u2019s been strange lately. No one's come through this grove in ages...\r\n"
  - "...and my lungs feel like they\u2019ve tangled with moss."
  - "You wouldn\u2019t happen to have... something for a sore throat, would you?"
  acceptOption: Give medicine to Mallow
  acceptAnswer: "Ahhh... much better. You don\u2019t know how long I\u2019ve been
    waiting for a potion like that."
  declineOption: Sorry I don't have medicine
  declineAnswer: If you find something that smells like mint and moonlight... bring
    it my way, yeah?
  comebackAfterDecline: If you find something that smells like mint and moonlight...
    bring it my way, yeah?
  comebackInProgress: If you find something that smells like mint and moonlight...
    bring it my way, yeah?
  comebackCompleted: "Ahhh... much better. You don\u2019t know how long I\u2019ve
    been waiting for a potion like that."
  finalWords: "I saw something strange moving in those tall plants \r\n\r\n...If
    it\u2019s one of your wandering hats, it might be worth a peek.\r\n"
